{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/78849-question-about-demon-pregnancy","id":78849,"title":"Question about Demon Pregnancy","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-02-24T17:44:40-08:00","id":78849,"title":"Question about Demon Pregnancy","content":"I was reading the part of demon talking about demon can have children. So I was wondering if the demon changes into the body of some one they made a deal with but they are 8 months pregnant when the demon takes over the body does the child have powers or no ?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-24T19:04:17-08:00","id":78946,"title":"","content":"Considering that the entire thing is basically up in the air and a giant plot hook... who knows?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-24T20:23:49-08:00","id":79035,"title":"","content":"I've been wondering that, since it says (somewhere) that a Demon's Cover ages while not in use, what if that Cover was pregnant? Does the embryo/fetus age as well? What happens after 9 months of gestation? What if there was a problem, and there would normally be a miscarriage?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Once is happenstance. Twice is coincidence. Three times is enemy action. Four times is Infrastructure.<br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><br /> Rule #2: Never let the game-mechanics get in the way of a good story.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1642-paddon","name":"Paddon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1642_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"326"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-24T21:41:10-08:00","id":79098,"title":"","content":"If a human was turned into a Cover during pregnancy, I might suggest the kid is Stigmatic on account of ending up so enmeshed in GMC/Demon technology, but does not count as a Primum-infused half-Demon, but the weight of my guess is as light as a fairy's fart. \\<br /> <br /> If a Demon changes Cover while pregnant, I would say the pregnancy is held in stasis along with other bodily functions and the fetus is not subject to the aging undergone by the Cover. If a Demon accumulates, say, a month of suspended pregnancy, I'd make that into a Compromise, and add further Compromises every two or three weeks accumulated after that. If a Cover is destroyed, so is the fetus. My reasoning for this is for the sake of rule simplicity, since coming to full term while the form is inactive might be a bit of a headache to consider; If anyone wants to discuss the metaphysical personhood of the fetus as a factor in whether or not it is subject to the aging that inactive Covers undergo, they'll probably end up in an abortion debate territory and the thread will be obliterated from on high faster than a full Demon/Demon offspring birthed in the middle of a GMC Facility during a Destroyer Angel armament convention.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/486-foolish-milex","name":"Foolish Milex","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar486_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"135"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-25T09:37:38-08:00","id":79393,"title":"","content":"Here's a little sneak peek of Heirs to Hell:<br /> <br /> If a demon's Cover is pregnant, and she changes into demonic form or into another Cover, the pregnancy continues normally. Remember that demons are simultaneously all of their Covers and their demonic form, so the Cover that's pregnant is still there, the demon just isn't using it right now.<br /> <br /> If, however, the demon goes loud while wearing that Cover, the pregnancy ends, because the Cover is <i>gone</i>.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13-blackhatmatt","name":"blackhatmatt","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"464"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-25T16:37:56-08:00","id":79747,"title":"","content":"@blackhatmatt: Thanks for confirming my two assumptions, but what happens if the pregnancy hits the 9 month mark (or whenever the kid was gonna pop out) when the Cover wasn't being used?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Once is happenstance. Twice is coincidence. Three times is enemy action. Four times is Infrastructure.<br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><br /> Rule #2: Never let the game-mechanics get in the way of a good story.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1642-paddon","name":"Paddon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1642_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"326"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-27T10:45:11-08:00","id":81130,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Paddon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/78849-question-about-demon-pregnancy?p=79747#post79747\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">@blackhatmatt: Thanks for confirming my two assumptions, but what happens if the pregnancy hits the 9 month mark (or whenever the kid was gonna pop out) when the Cover wasn't being used?</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh, I see. What happens if the demon doesn't assume that Cover for longer than a pregnancy would conceivably last? Hmm. <br /> <br /> Well, Covers progress and age whether or not you're in them. As such, it might be that the next time you assume that Cover, the child appears, ages, and progresses to the point that s/he logically would have. If I'm running the game, I call for a hell of a compromise roll at that point.<br /> <br /> Another possibility is that the demons starts feeling that Cover start to destabilize. A new person, and thus a new soul, is coming together, and that means the demon either has to facilitate that or lose it (in which case I guess you'd be looking at a stillbirth).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13-blackhatmatt","name":"blackhatmatt","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"464"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}